 savings cited.  \n\n(Miami: Mark Potter) Hard times for people saving for retirement and for retirees on fixed incomes examined; details given about drops in retirement accounts and housing prices and increases in unemployment, living costs and health care; the drop in public pension plans and 401k plans cited. [Florida landlord Mark PRINCE, retiree John ROGERS&nbsp- react.] ", "segment_duration": 340, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920098, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GAkmM0Zw2l", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-08", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920097, "segment_id": "zZNX11M98C", "segment_broadcast_id": "GAkmM0Zw2l", "segment_title": "Decision 2008 / Obama vs. McCain / Nashville Debate", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) The viewership for last night\u2019s presidential debate between Senators John McCain and Barack Obama cited.   (Washington: Andrea Mitchell) The return to the campaign trail by McCain and Obama featured; details given about McCain\u2019s continuing attacks on Obama, the reaction to his calling Obama \u201cthat one\u201d last night and criticism of his response to questioner Oliver Clark&#134;&#134;; statement from Lehigh County, Pennsylvania, Republican Party chairman William Platt&#134; referring to \u201cBarack Hussein Obama\u201d quoted. [In Pennsylvania, Cindy McCAIN \u2013 criticizes Obama for not supporting her son in Iraq.] [Senator Joe BIDEN \u2013 challenges outrageous inferences from Governor Sarah Palin.] [On \u201cToday,\u201d BIDEN \u2013 comments on McCain.] [In Indianapolis, OBAMA \u2013 campaigns.]   (Studio: Brian Williams; Washington: Chuck Todd) The electoral map, Obama\u2019s momentum and the \u201cPalin strategy\u201d discussed; Obama\u2019s outspending of McCain noted. ", "segment_duration": 320, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63390.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920099, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GAkmM0Zw2l", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-08", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920097, "segment_id": "Z6NAoObzLy", "segment_broadcast_id": "GAkmM0Zw2l", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63710.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920100, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GAkmM0Zw2l", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-08", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920097, "segment_id": "AGhrlMg781", "segment_broadcast_id": "GAkmM0Zw2l", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Januvia; Claritin; Touch of Gray; Cheerios.)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63720.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920101, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadc